---
import { assets, storyUses } from "../../data/site";
---

<section id="story" class="relative min-h-[820px] overflow-hidden bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_78%_18%,rgba(63,105,165,0.35),transparent_34rem),#061121] py-20">
  <div class="relative mx-auto grid min-h-[680px] w-full max-w-[1680px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-16">
    <div class="max-w-[840px]">
      <div class="relative z-[1]">
        <p class="eyebrow text-xl">STORY</p>
        <div class="mt-5 h-0.5 w-14 bg-gold-400"></div>
        <h2 class="mt-12 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.28] tracking-normal text-white sm:text-6xl xl:text-[4.6rem]">
          充電忘れも、通信不安も、<br />もう持ち歩かない。
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-8 text-2xl leading-relaxed text-white">
          <span class="font-bold text-gold-400">乾電池3本</span>で使えるWi-Fi搭載モバイルバッテリー。
        </p>
      </div>

      <img class="md:absolute top-0 right-0 w-full md:w-[40%] max-w-[790px]" src={assets.productCharging} alt="Twin Function 本体" />

      <div class="relative mt-14 grid gap-2 max-w-[760px] grid-cols-3 pb-5 before:absolute before:left-[8%] before:right-[8%] before:top-[7.4rem] before:h-px before:bg-white/45">
        {storyUses.map((item) => (
          <article class="relative text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto grid h-24 w-24 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/35 bg-white/[0.02]">
              <img class="h-16 w-16 object-contain" src={item.icon} alt="" />
            </div>
            <span class="relative top-4 z-[1] mx-auto block h-5 w-5 rounded-full bg-gold-400 shadow-[0_0_18px_rgba(255,208,41,0.55)]"></span>
            <h3 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold text-white">{item.title}</h3>
            <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[190px] text-base leading-7 text-white/82">{item.text}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 md:grid max-w-[1100px] grid-cols-[180px_210px_1fr] items-center rounded-lg border border-white/25 bg-ink-950/58 p-6 shadow-insetLine">
      <div class="mx-auto grid h-32 w-32 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold-400 text-center text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-gold-400">
        乾電池<br />3本<br />で使える
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <img class="w-44 mx-auto" src="/assets/visuals/batteries.png" alt="" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gold-400">コンビニやスーパーで手に入る乾電池3本で、いつでもすぐに使える。</h3>
        <p class="mt-5 text-xl leading-9 text-white/86">充電環境がなくても、電池を入れ替えるだけ。日常使いはもちろん、万が一の備えとしても心強い一台です。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
